infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title A valid signature proves integrity — not trust
  desc The signature verified; closing the gap to "I can trust this token" is on you
  compares
    - label A signature PROVES
      children
        - label Integrity
          desc the payload bytes were not altered by anyone without the key
        - label Provenance
          desc the key-holder (the issuer) put these claims into the token
    - label It does NOT prove
      children
        - label Freshness — exp / nbf
          desc a signature never expires; only exp stops a leaked token
        - label Audience — aud
          desc minted for THIS API, not replayed from a sibling service
        - label Issuer — iss
          desc from your trusted IdP, not another authority
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
